et and Soaring artwork.","evidence_claim":"UNT says the Meditation Room is on level 4 of the Union, is open to the campus community, and is intended for reflection and destressing.","source_url":"https://studentaffairs.unt.edu/university-union/visit/in-the-union.html","source_title":"In The Union | University of North Texas","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Observe the room’s posted quiet-use guidelines and check Union access hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unt-pohl-recreation-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Pohl Recreation Center","title":"Try a campus recreation option","subtitle":"1900 Chestnut Street","notes":"Check the current recreation schedule, then plan a visit around an available activity such as the climbing wall, pools, courts, or indoor soccer gym.","short_summary":"UNT’s recreation facility with fitness, aquatics, climbing, courts, and outdoor-pursuits resources.","evidence_claim":"UNT lists a 45-foot climbing wall, two pools, and an indoor soccer gym among Pohl Recreation Center recreation options.","source_url":"https://www.unt.edu/admissions/apply/campus-life.html","source_title":"Campus Life | The UNT Experience | University of North Texas","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current summer 2026 Pohl Rec Center hours include Sunday 12–10 p.m., Monday–Thursday 6 a.m.–10 p.m., Friday 6 a.m.–9 p.m., and Saturday 8 a.m.–7 p.m.; membership or eligibility may apply.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unt-community-garden","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"UNT Community Garden","title":"End with a garden walk","subtitle":"UNT Community Garden • UNT campus","notes":"Visit the garden as a slower final stop and look ov